WEBVTT

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.669
Previously on Smallville.

00:00:04.669 --> 00:00:08.669
I sent you to Earth for a purpose, Kala.

00:00:12.669 --> 00:00:14.669
You've learned a lot from your time instead.

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:16.670
Your father would be proud.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.670
It would be tragic.

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:23.670
If the DDS decided Chloe was a threat to national security after all.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.670
Will you marry me?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.670
Don't move!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.670
Chloe Sullivan, you're under arrest.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.670
Jimmy, get Cork!

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.670
I need you.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.670
But the world needs you more.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:37.670
Please, don't come after me.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:42.719
Because I'm leaving doesn't mean you have to stay.

00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:46.719
Got your application right here.

00:00:46.719 --> 00:00:48.719
That's never gonna happen.

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:50.719
This isn't the end of the story, Clark.

00:00:50.719 --> 00:00:52.719
This is just the beginning.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:56.719
I can heal people.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:01:05.120
You must save yourself, or your destiny will fall into the hands of another man.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.620
Sir, the last few teams have all disappeared.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.620
We leave now.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.620
You hold the future of the entire planet in your hands.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.620
I'm here to take it back.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.620
Let's go!

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:18.989
But it has to end this way.

00:01:18.989 --> 00:01:31.239
And now, the season premiere of Smallville.

00:01:31.239 --> 00:02:05.040
Who's Regan?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.040
What have you been doing all this time?

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.039
Building Snowmen?

00:02:08.039 --> 00:02:09.039
Who do you think you are?

00:02:09.039 --> 00:02:13.830
This site is off-limit.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:14.830
Tess Mercer.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.830
My access is unrestricted.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.830
Perlex's written instructions.

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:20.830
I'm now the acting CEO of Uther Corp

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:27.400
and all its subsidiaries.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.900
You're nothing but an obscure regional VP.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.900
You actually believe you're qualified?

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.900
Lex believes it.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.900
And that's all that matters.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.900
I want a complete inventory of everything you found.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:42.900
Footprints, snowmobile tracks, any sign of an escape.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.900
Escape?

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:47.080
Trust me.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:51.080
Lex Luthor did not meet his end on some dwindling ice cap.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.080
Sonar's picking something up.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.580
6.4 meters deep.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:57.580
What is it?

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:47.819
I'm not sure, but based on the imaging, it would very well be human remains.

00:03:47.819 --> 00:03:49.819
There's a reason the Cowboys won the West.

00:03:49.819 --> 00:03:52.819
Playing with bows and arrows can only get you so far.

00:03:56.819 --> 00:04:00.669
Nice toss.

00:04:00.669 --> 00:04:02.669
For a fish out of water.

00:04:02.669 --> 00:04:03.669
Thanks.

00:04:03.669 --> 00:04:04.669
You two going to keep stroking each other?

00:04:04.669 --> 00:04:05.669
Are we going to go find Clark?

00:04:05.669 --> 00:04:07.669
It looks like they found something in that trench.

00:04:07.669 --> 00:04:08.669
Check it out.

00:04:08.669 --> 00:04:18.600
Oh, no.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:06:40.060
Clark, where are you?

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.060
Floors? They've lost their sheen.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.560
You're not getting lazy, are you?

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:56.850
