00:07:21.959 --> 00:07:26.560
Lex's 4 p.m. booty call?

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:31.560
I realize Mr. Luther gave you quite a bit of journalistic rope, knowing you'd eventually hang yourself.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.560
Me, on the other hand,

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:36.560
