00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.560
I'm not here as a reporter.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.560
I'm here to find my cousin, Chloe Sullivan.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.560
I doubt she's hiding under the furniture.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.560
Lex had her arrested by the Department of Domestic Security,

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:50.560
but the DDS claims to have no record of her.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.560
I want access to Lex's phone records from the day he made the call.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.560
I want that agent's name.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:08:01.560
Mr. Luther is a firm believer in truth and justice, Ms. Lane.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.560
You can rest assured if he had your country,

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.560
arrested, she was guilty.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:09.250
I think Chloe's been guilty of.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.250
He's standing up for what she believes in.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.250
Ms. Mercer?

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.250
Please escort Miss Lane out.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.250
Yes, ma'am?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.250
Hands off.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:21.250
By the way, next time,

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.250
might want to try microfiber.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.250
Works wonders.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.250
I'll keep that in mind.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:09:03.850
Take your time with this one. It's especially difficult.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.850
Barn, Tiger, Car, Hammer, Tree, Building, Cup,

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.850
Toaster, House Doll, Football Book, Umbrella,

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:15.820
bench paperclip. The seventh image moves forward by the power of four every six cycles.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:23.500
Okay, so I'm smarter than the average, but that doesn't mean the government has the right

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.500
to treat me like their own private guinea pig.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.500
You're special, Chloe.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.500
No, I'm not.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.500
All I am is a halfway decent hacker who took a wrong turn down the information superhighway.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:35.500
A hacker whose cognitive thinking just beat our fastest supercomputer.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:40.500
It's hard to believe that such a dramatic increase in intelligence could occur practically overnight.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:44.500
I've told you a thousand times it just happened.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.500
I passed out.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.500
and when I woke up, I was different.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.500
Okay.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.500
Let's do another.

