Have you looked at a map recently?

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.320
This is America. I know my rights.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:07.320
The day you hacked into the NASA mainframe and download a classified information,

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:10.320
