00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.320
You committed an act of treason.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.320
I'm not a spy.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:16.320
I don't deserve to be held in some low-rent,

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.320
Get Mo wannabe.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.320
You can stay here and you can use your ability

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:23.320
to get back to your country and walk in 12 months.

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:26.320
Or you can go to court, get convicted,

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:29.320
