00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.320
That's your choice.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:42.480
He ran his photo through every surveillance camera

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.480
north of 60 degrees latitude.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:46.480
Face recognition hasn't come up with a single hit.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:49.480
Every dock in coastline east of the Siberian Sea to the Baffin Bay.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.480
They're Clark Kent free zones.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.480
Looks like it just disappeared.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.480
Well, that leaves us with Chloe's hard draw.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:56.480
with Chloe's hard drive, which is full of a lot of fun facts,

