Don't you remember your little journey up north in the Luther Corp jet right before Lex disappeared?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:16.620
I honored Mr. Luther's request for absolute discretion.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:25.320
Have you been searching for Lex or are you just covering your own tracks?

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.320
I did my homework on.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.669
You?

00:14:28.669 --> 00:14:31.669
Girl who taught herself to read in a Louisiana swamp house.

00:14:31.669 --> 00:14:35.669
Got into Harvard at 15, goes deep sea diving in her spare time.

